==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* The [[Swords of Justice]] defeat both the [[Shadow Triad]] and the Striaton [[Gym Leader]]s.
* {{p|Cobalion}}, {{p|Terrakion}} and {{p|Virizion}} are hit by [[Team Plasma]]'s {{p|Genesect|secret weapon's}} attack and are frozen, sinking into the sea.
* [[N's Castle]] appears from beneath the [[Pokémon League (Unova)|Pokémon League]] and [[Team Plasma]] appears.
* {{adv|Black}} and {{p|Reshiram}} face [[N]] and {{p|Zekrom}}.
* The Gym Leaders are freed.
* {{adv|White}} meets [[Anthea and Concordia]] who tell her about N and his past.
* Black defeats N.
* Black battles with [[Ghetsis]] and defeats him.
* N sees the error of his ways and bids farewell.
* Black is thrown onto Reshiram as it is reverting back into the [[Light Stone]] and disappears.
* Several {{tc|Team Plasma Grunt}}s escape and go into hiding.
* {{adv|Whitley|One}} of the Grunts receives a [[Foongy|Foongus]] from Anthea and Concordia that was liberated by N and a locket containing N's photograph.

